  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify; line-height: 140%;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 140%; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\">(10 fotos) Carmina Ballester Feliu ser&aacute; la primera alcaldesa de Onda despu&eacute;s de que el PP haya recuperado la mayor&iacute;a absoluta (11 concejal&iacute;as ahora) que ya consigui&oacute; en 2011 y que perdi&oacute; en 2015 por el pacto del PSPV-PSOE (que ahora ha subido a 9 concejal&iacute;as) con Onda S&iacute; Se Puede, EUPV y Comprom&iacute;s, la &uacute;nica formaci&oacute;n que ha logrado mantener el concejal.</font></span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/celebracioppmajoriaabsolutaonda/img_7365.jpg\" alt=\"img_7365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/celebracioppmajoriaabsolutaonda/img_7366.jpg\" alt=\"img_7366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/celebracioppmajoriaabsolutaonda/img_7367.jpg\" alt=\"img_7367\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/celebracioppmajoriaabsolutaonda/img_7368.jpg\" alt=\"img_7368\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/celebracioppmajoriaabsolutaonda/img_7371.jpg\" alt=\"img_7371\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/celebracioppmajoriaabsolutaonda/img_7372.jpg\" alt=\"img_7372\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/celebracioppmajoriaabsolutaonda/img_7373.jpg\" alt=\"img_7373\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f